Z||000000||gtsonly||09-10-2000||07:49 PM||||I have been sickened by the sight of a Red formula with yellow highlights. My god, even the speaker grills have been painted. Stock exhaust for right now but I would lay a large chunk of change that coffee can tips will be installed anytime soon. Those fancy 200.00 dollar Holley scoops that sell on Ebay, he took and painted yellow all while taking time to remove the Holley emblem and paint it red and then replace it on the scoop. Funny thing is I saw a Honda Accord with the same paint scheme. Only thing it is missing is more aerodynamics to give it the image of flying! Not to knock a man for trying to be different, but try not to copy what every rice runner is doing to his car <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR> <P>------------------<BR>Chris Hatch <BR>1986 GT w/T-TOPS<BR>http://www.fiero.nl/cgi-bin/fiero/ubbmisc.cgi||||reg||5
