Z||000004||zeusrekning||09-10-2000||08:52 PM||||I really don't want to start any flaming. But I like red with yellow highlights. <BR>Red is a darker color that stands out.<BR>yellow is a bright color that stands out. <BR>Red+yellow really stands out. <BR>I have a 4 inch monza tip on my fiero and it looked great new with the yellow strip around it. I understand it looks ricy and on my next fiero i want have a fart can. BUT. I was thinking of painting the car red with yellow highlights and yellow rims. Make em look. Here are some pics after riding my cart so it is real dusty.<BR>And i understand you are just stating your opinion and I was not upset. Unless you were talking about my fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">to each his own is our motto for tonight.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycar_2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/myrear.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/scoop_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/vent.jpg"> <P>My favorite you can see the clouds<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headlight.jpg"> <P><p>[This message has been edited by zeusrekning (edited 09-10-2000).]||||reg||1
