Z||000006||gtsonly||09-10-2000||09:38 PM||||Like I was saying, there is nothing wrong with creating a car to your likeness. By all means do it if it makes you happy. Thats what is fun about autos. it is just that sometimes people can take modifying to the next level. " The Rice Level "  have fun with your cars and modify them all you want but when you have gone to far just remember to take the fiero badge off and slap on a honda sticker. There is a difference between customizing and ricing!!!!  To each, his own!!||||reg||6
