Z||000014||HugGRRRFiero||09-11-2000||11:09 AM||||To each his own...<P>The yellow accents on that red IMO are a bit much, but I wouldn't necessarily call it a "ricer."  <P>Anybody remember those chrome or fluorescent pink wiper arms?  And strobe lights seem to be the next thing big thing since driving lights with lowered S-10's, probably ricer's too but not too many of those around here.<P>So, I'll leave everyone with this though, does a guy who lowers his Fiero mean we call him a "Lowrider?"<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">  <BR>  <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||1
